    "current_section": "{{rfd links|1=Q140288589|2=Not notable.}}\n\nNot notable. [[User:William Graham|William Graham]] ([[User talk:William Graham|<span class=\"signature-talk\">{{int:Talkpagelinktext}}</span>]]) 02:22, 20 August 2026 (UTC)\n: {{on hold}} This item is linked from 3 others. --[[User:DeltaBot|DeltaBot]] ([[User talk:DeltaBot|<span class=\"signature-talk\">{{int:Talkpagelinktext}}</span>]]) 02:31, 20 August 2026 (UTC)\n:'''Keep.''' Q140288589 is a non-category item representing a real-world clinic ({{P|31}}: {{Q|1774898}}) and has a valid Wikimedia Commons sitelink to [[:commons:Category:Dr. Saeed Ghezelbash Aesthetic Clinic]], added on 15 August 2026, before this RfD. Under the current text of [[Wikidata:Notability|WD:N criterion 1]], a valid Wikimedia Commons sitelink satisfies criterion 1. N1.4 excludes only ''category items'' with only a Commons sitelink; Q140288589 is not a category item. Therefore the item satisfies current WD:N criterion 1 independently of criteria 2 or 3. For transparency, I am connected to the subject and will avoid further substantive edits to the item while this RfD is open. [[User:Medicaldoctor91|Medicaldoctor91]] ([[User talk:Medicaldoctor91|<span class=\"signature-talk\">{{int:Talkpagelinktext}}</span>]]) 00:14, 23 August 2026 (UTC)",
